FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Lineframing --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.MCPdispatcher <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "2: Dispatch\n<size:12>[In-process]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.MCPdispatcher --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Configurationandselectorresolution <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "3: Validate caller selectors and resolve caller over Cline defaults\n<size:12>[In-process]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Configurationandselectorresolution --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Frenemyselectorconfiguration <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "4: Read validated startup defaults\n<size:12>[Filesystem / JSON]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Configurationandselectorresolution --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Clineinvocation <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "5: Supply provider, model and effort\n<size:12>[In-process]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.MCPdispatcher --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Clineinvocation <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "6: Dispatch under the shared relay deadline and capacity\n<size:12>[In-process]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Clineinvocation --> ClineCLI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "7: ACP init/session and prompt with child-only provider/model env and --thinking; translate exact permission options\n<size:12>[ACP stdio]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Clineinvocation --> ClineCLI <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlwLEFkZGVk>> : "8: Close native child before final answer/error\n<size:12>[ACP stdio]</size>"
FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.MCPdispatcher --> FrenemyTARGETDESIGN.Blockingagentrelay.Responsesanitization <<Relationship-UmVsYXRpb25zaGlw>> : "9: Clean final answer/error before MCP response\n<size:12>[In-process]</size>"

